senses.gloss:
बिस bísa, n. root or underground stalk of 🞄the lotus: kisalaya-ccheda-pātheya-vat, 🞄[] 🞄a. having as provisions for the journey pieces 🞄of young root-fibres of the lotus;
 -granthi, 🞄m. knot on a root-fibre of the lotus;
 -tantu, 🞄m. fibre of the lotus root: -maya, a. made 🞄of the fibrous root of the lotus;
 -prasūnu, 🞄n. flower of the lotus;
 -latā, f. lotus (nelumbium 🞄speciosum);
 -vat-i, f. place abounding 🞄in fibrous roots of the lotus.
